187688_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tusb9sPXNxYQ7kNvwGKhFzm&_nc_oc=AdnI3zuPD_XA0RHMMB5x-Vss_1MsiAPfqNPvxqK3Lz1Q5K3RCDX02LUDvZUX9GqPkRw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvYMomZ-M7NgPJdAF5RkbSczMncz_7slfHezWYugBBLqw&oe=69986B08"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LandScape.png", "id": "4526900444203911", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_4526900447537244_1593155788570280980_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pspti8GFEHkQ7kNvwE_NcBY&_nc_oc=Adm6pc-yNcU3_QcKMiQY7f9ocq4FnxQnNhUAFj0jdkb21nuoBm2T8DuO0HODexoMHtk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuFn-EE884zKlzey1Rta7w8F4qVenQscWtItbH0dHV0Bw&oe=699861E6"}, "display_name": "The Historical Art Gallery", "keywords": ["AI", "Gallery", "Art", "Paintings", "History"], "long_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings.", "short_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blo